pe="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Micevska</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Warne</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Pablo</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Patra</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Variation in, and causes of, toxicity of cigarette butts to a cladoceran and microtox</article-title><source>Arch. Environ. Contam. Toxicol</source><year>2006</year><volume>50</volume><fpage>205</fpage><lpage>212</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16328625</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b21-ijerph-06-01691"><label>21.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>CDC</collab></person-group><article-title>Ingestion of cigarettes and cigarette butts by children&#x02013;Rhode Island, January 1994-July 1996</article-title><source>Morb. Mortal. Wkly. Rep</source><year>1997</year><volume>46</volume><fpage>125</fpage><lpage>128</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b22-ijerph-06-01691"><label>22.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="web"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sanders</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Philip</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><source>Degradable Materials</source>Available online: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://legacy.library.ucsf.edu/tid/ahh48e00/">http://legacy.library.ucsf.edu/tid/ahh48e00/</ext-link></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b23-ijerph-06-01691"><label>23.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="web"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wahal</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><italic>Proposed Development Program for Dispersible Cigarette Filters/</italic>20-488. 26 Jan 1994. Brown &#x00026; Williamson. Available online: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://legacy.library.ucsf.edu/tid/ibv0